# 🎉 Python Fun Fact

Many professional command-line tools automatically generate `--help` screens using libraries like `argparse`, making them easier for users to understand.

---

# 🔄 Quick Recap

- `argparse` simplifies command-line programming.
- It automatically validates arguments.
- `--help` documentation is generated for free.
- Named options make programs easier to use.

